From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 14:16:48 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] drm/asahi: g16: Default to 12 compute units per VM

With 8 compute units the compute horizon keeps at most 7 commands
queued behind a running one. On the M4 a small compute command that is
already queued starts 10-20 us after its predecessor, close to macOS,
but about two thirds of compute.light's commands still reach the
firmware only after the previous one ended. When the stats show the
depth / compute-unit cap as the refusal that holds them, a deeper
horizon is the lever.

Default g16_compute_units to 12 (the maximum the previous commit
allows), so up to 11 commands queue behind a running one. Each unit
costs about 33 MiB per VM that runs compute, allocated at its first
compute command. g16_compute_units=8 restores the previous depth.

Assisted-by: LLM
Signed-off-by: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
---
 drivers/gpu/drm/asahi/g16/params.rs | 6 +++---
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/asahi/g16/params.rs b/drivers/gpu/drm/asahi/g16/params.rs
index 629e5a542e..6a11d60828 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/asahi/g16/params.rs
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/asahi/g16/params.rs
@@ -601,8 +601,8 @@ pub(crate) fn horizon_depth() -> u64 {
     (HORIZON.load(Ordering::Relaxed) as u64).clamp(1, compute_units() as u64 - 1)
 }
 
-/// Storage of `g16_compute_units` (0644, default 8; latched at the engine start).
-static COMPUTE_UNITS: AtomicU32 = AtomicU32::new(8);
+/// Storage of `g16_compute_units` (0644, default 12; latched at the engine start).
+static COMPUTE_UNITS: AtomicU32 = AtomicU32::new(12);
 /// The latched compute units, 0 until latched.
 static COMPUTE_UNITS_LATCH: AtomicU32 = AtomicU32::new(0);
 
@@ -626,7 +626,7 @@ pub(crate) fn compute_units() -> usize {
     COMPUTE_UNITS_PARM,
     COMPUTE_UNITS,
     "g16_compute_units",
-    "G16: compute units per VM, one compute command in flight each (default 8; 2..12; 4 = k908; 9..12 = deeper compute queue, ~33 MiB per unit; latched at the engine start, set it as a module option)"
+    "G16: compute units per VM, one compute command in flight each (default 12; 2..12; 8 = before; 4 = k908; 9..12 = deeper compute queue, ~33 MiB per unit; latched at the engine start, set it as a module option)"
 );
 
 live_u32_param!(
